# Keep the build context small; the build needs only Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, crates/ and bin/.
**/target
.git
.github
.claude
deploy
docs
compose.yaml
dev
**/*.md
# The coder's prompt and A2A card, embedded by bin/adam-coder/build.rs (`agent/instructions.md`).
!bin/adam-coder/agent/**
# Crate READMEs are compiled in as rustdoc (`#![doc = include_str!("../README.md")]`).
!crates/*/README.md
!bin/*/README.md
